    "sections": {
        "description": "Bosa Shopper is a fast, lightweight WordPress theme for e-commerce, beauty products, women's fashion, smart home products, sports, toy shops, gadgets stores, jewelry shops, men's clothing, electronics, furniture, retail, and digital products sites, built for Elementor and WooCommerce. Launch your site visually - no code required. Built with SEO, speed, and usability in mind, Bosa Shopper supports custom headers, footers, and mega menus with Elementor, and includes a full starter site you can import in one click. Works seamlessly with Elementor and Gutenberg, and stays compatible with major plugins like WooCommerce, Yoast, Contact Form 7, and Mailchimp. Bosa Shopper also works with BEW, an Elementor addon offering widgets, templates, and AI-powered content generation."
    },
